{"server":"cn","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_05_end","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_05","title":"葬礼","storyCode":"GA-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"5e50c8f6887977c6ffbc67c9b7596c92624a180fd2b088c4a7a19cd14561d414","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亚，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔哥哥！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先导......我们不能退让了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！别想把塞茜莉亚当成筹码！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......艾泽尔！带塞茜莉亚过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，艾泽尔！你到底怎么回事！难道你真和这帮......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"异端分子还是恐怖组织？教廷也只能想出这种无聊的罪名了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂亚，滚开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔......你说得对，没有谁的想法能够轻易改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我都一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎过得不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"托你的福。你倒是老了不少......“队长”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是托你的福。那处铳伤很久才好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，不错。总好过挨她的子弹吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安差点就死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总好过挨她的子弹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来你的疯病并没好多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那边的小子，你就是那个艾泽尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（又一个万国信使吗......现在究竟应该......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......堕天使？！菲亚梅塔小姐，这是怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，是啊，堕天。理所当然，你用铳对我射击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你感受不到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，现在，我会用眼睛观察，用心判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边的小姑娘，是叫塞茜莉亚对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你有角，也有光环......你是萨科塔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，可能算是？不过我也不太确定呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听着，艾泽尔，带塞茜莉亚过来。她不会有事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一个堕天使的承诺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总比那个凶巴巴的黎博利更可信吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你说的是对面那个对吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......莫斯提马，她母亲的葬礼还没有结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，我差点信了，安多恩，你是这么尽职尽责的安魂教堂主祭吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马！你跟我来是为了和他叙旧的吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔，想好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亚，我们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亚......你还有没做完的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩，你这儿人可真够多的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么大阵仗，就为了接一个塞茜莉亚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，还有句话要带给你。锁与匙里的那家伙让我告诉你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勇气可嘉，但你不会喜欢最终答案的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢建言。虽然没有机会与它同行，但当年它为我掀开纱幔一角，已使我受益良多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看看你现在的样子，你确定是“受益”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯人自知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不对，艾泽尔，后退！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你能相信吗——\n我看到了一片信仰凝结而成的海洋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......以上，就是本次的行动报告。在座部分同僚此前已参与到事件中，报告如有遗漏，烦请补充。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同僚们，我提请全城立刻进入戒严状态。安多恩就够麻烦的了，现在还加上了“混血萨科塔”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳骑吉奥瓦尼阁下，会议很快就要开幕，现在全城戒严，你知道会在外国使节中引起怎样的恐慌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"枢机，对于这样的危险分子，若是仅仅“引起一些恐慌”就能解决问题，那就是最好的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗阁下筹备多年的会议......未来的“万国峰会”，它可能成为拉特兰立足于大地的基点之一。但现在，一场恐慌就足以毁了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如何知道，放任安多恩，他就不会毁了这场会议？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳骑吉奥瓦尼阁下，您太紧张了，不过是一群不成气候的丧家之徒和一个来路不明的女孩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥伦，你以为拉特兰城为什么能够维持千年和平与安宁？任何不稳定因素都值得警惕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......就拉特兰人这个天天大街放炮仗的德行吗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳骑吉奥瓦尼阁下，您该不会是好久没动用您那把威风的大铳了，想找点事情活动活动吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以我的铳为荣，有什么问题吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......几位阁下，事态紧急，或许容我继续？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诸位想必了解，我和莫斯提马曾与安多恩......共事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就我了解，安多恩的风格是不做多余之事，不开无准备之战。因此，即使他有能力在拉特兰制造混乱，也不会制造无目的之混乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前，除了意图控制名为塞茜莉亚的混血女孩，迷途者没有留下针对其他方向的行动痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合理推测迷途者此行主要目的即为夺取塞茜莉亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鉴于对方已经得手，我认为下一步他最有可能的行动应当是......离开拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因此，我建议接下来的行动重视以下两个方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，提高边境管理等级，增派戍卫队驻守出入关口，可组建特勤队伍隐蔽搜索迷途者藏身处，缉捕安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其次，保险起见，请第七厅牵头调查迷途者是否与到访使节或其他会议经办人员接触，评估迷途者以会议为目标的概率，提交对策案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于会议本身......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续按日程推呗，薇尔丽芙就想这样吧。反正这一次不是试水吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦不过，冷餐会的甜点太难吃了，仙人掌挞是不是有点离谱？望改进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是觉得很有风味嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有这点，我与莫斯提马意见一致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡说！照我看口味非常不错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然铳骑吉奥瓦尼阁下都发话了，我想我们可以达成一致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉奥瓦尼喜欢的一定难吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马，你这是在藐视我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子们，把声音放低点，我老啦，经不起嚷嚷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"律令指引我们对前所未有之事报以善意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不应对水果挞如此苛刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我怎么不知道这条“律令”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天早上刚想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":".................."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗阁下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就按你说的办吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇尔，吉奥瓦尼，帮着点菲亚梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩......自会行至他的终点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g1_laterano_cathedralfront"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，所以说我最讨厌闭门会议......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正题三分钟就谈完了，其他时间都在胡扯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位，阁下们的决定是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还在这儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缉捕安多恩的事我来接手。这几天你也辛苦了，回家休息吧。我会和公证所那边打招呼，之前的事就算你配合我这边行动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔小姐，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的事已经超出你的职权和能力范围。别忘了，你实训期都没过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你担心塞茜莉亚。但这件事由我接手，已经是你能指望的最好情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔小姐，你和这位......堕天使小姐，是朋友吗？你们和安多恩，是......旧识？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是对两个问题的回答吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是旧识，是旧仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你放心，我不会迁怒塞茜莉亚，虽然我不明白早上她为什么......但她只是个小孩子而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你，你在那个地方待了两天，安多恩和你说什么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一些离经叛道的话而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我建议你全忘掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有自己的生活，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去休几天假，然后在公证所好好干，我看你资质不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要珍惜哦，拉特兰的生活是很珍贵的。连我这种人，有时候也会怀念一下呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自己的生活......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也对，和他们比起来，我明明只是个普通人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下班了下班了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g8_laterano_dwelling"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戍卫队已经全面接管边卡，教宗骑士也在盯着，暂时没办法走了......虽然准备了安全屋，可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥伦那边也联系不上......该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我们可以等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后悔了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果和菲亚梅塔姐姐走，就要去......大教堂了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没有想明白......和妈妈道别的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，塞茜莉亚，你可以慢慢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......修士先生，刚才在安魂教堂，有一个又有角又有光环的姐姐，她......是萨科塔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是，也许不是。她自己决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为......萨科塔就是萨科塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对于大部分人来说，确实如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但有的人可以选择，或者说不得不选择，出于一些......不幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很巧，塞茜莉亚，你也要选择。至于这是你的不幸还是幸运......无人可知晓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨科塔不能和萨卡兹在一起吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然可以，你就是明证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我......是不是给大家添麻烦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔哥哥也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亚，如果你这样担心，就什么也做不了了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们总会争斗。“温柔”也好，“理解”也好，停止不了这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多时候人与人争斗，不是因为哪一方善，哪一方恶，而是因为彼此要做的事互相抵牾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是说，你和我要做的事不一样，我们常常会挡在别人的路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么大家不能一起走呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为许多人的去路是由来路决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"譬如萨科塔与萨卡兹。即使已经没有人能说出最初争斗的缘由，数千年的仇恨也已经筑成道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道路不是可以自己选吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以，塞茜莉亚，但没那么容易。你想要离开原来的道路，寻找新的道路，就要走到无边的荒原上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茫茫旷野，也许永远无法找到，你却付出了一生与一切，作为代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那，那为什么还要找......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，为什么还要找呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许只是想要这么做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“想要”......有这么重要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是我们唯一拥有的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修士先生......我可以问吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问吧，塞茜莉亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想要的是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塞茜莉亚，我可以和你讲个故事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，修士先生，您请讲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多年前，我还年轻的时候，我遇到了......挫折，然后我就离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去哪里呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去任何地方，四处......旅行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在一个地方待了一阵子，一个很小的小镇，和我的家乡有点像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是更破败，更衰落，每个人都过得艰难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咦？这听上去一点都不像拉特兰啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次我路过镇上的酒馆，撞到一个哼着歌的酒鬼，他吐了我一身，还说是我绊倒了他，要我替他把酒钱付了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酒馆里的每一个人，不对，镇上的每一个人都笑话他、咒骂他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胆子小的人躲着他走，大家说他是肮脏龌龊的混蛋、无赖、病痨鬼......那是一个萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但没有人真的把他赶出镇子，他就这么勉勉强强活着，做点零工度日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一天晚上，刮风，下很大的雨，没有人愿意出门。但是教堂的钟声响了，是示警的钟声，吵醒了每一个人......有，坏人来了镇上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好在钟声吵醒了大家。虽然很艰难，最终还是把坏人赶走了。谁也不知道钟是谁敲响的，大家都说这一定是神迹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我顺着钟楼方向找到外面的荒地，发现了正在掘墓的教堂看门人，旁边的板车上是一口薄棺材，里面躺着遍体鳞伤的萨卡兹酒鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帮忙掘墓，看门人一边挖一边骂，抱怨留给自己老娘的棺材便宜了萨卡兹，又咒骂得病的萨卡兹得赶快埋了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看门人说，钟响了没多久，萨卡兹来拍他的门让他趁乱快跑，然后就死在门口了，晦气得不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看门人说，他只是看要下雨了，有点不忍心，让萨卡兹在钟楼凑合一晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他一边骂，一边挖土。把人埋了之后，站在坟前，学着唱酒鬼总唱的那首歌，但又没记住后面的调子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后骂了两句，倒了半瓶酒在坟头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高高山上的风♪......随英雄远去♪......行过长路♪......踏过荆棘♪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真抱歉，我也没记住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......那首歌，妈妈教给我的，罗塞菈姐姐教给我的歌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，是那个萨卡兹敲响了钟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他也是救了大家的英雄了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是吧。我不知道他这样的人能不能被称为英雄。很多人大概不会愿意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定他也只是想让帮了自己一把的看门人能跑掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那修士先生你呢，你觉得他是英雄吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......英雄又是什么呢，塞茜莉亚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我确实想了很久......但我知道，回答这个问题，决定的不是那个萨卡兹是什么人，而是我是什么人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若说他自己，我想他不会是为了成为英雄登上钟楼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论我们赞美他，贬低他，抑或将他忘却，都与他无关了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一切的辗转反侧，只与我自己有关......为什么我会目睹这件事？它对我意味着什么？它要给予我怎样的启示？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被考问的总是活着的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我总在想，我总在想，如果他不做，会如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他做了，反而把狂信......坏人引来钟楼会如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇上的人被叫醒了也抵挡不住会如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至，要是他死在钟楼上无人发现，然后......会如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有必成的做法，没有必定正确的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后我想，在那个滂沱大雨的深夜，他登上钟楼，只是因为他想那么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个最直接的念头，一点点拗不过去的善意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成与不成，不是他的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是英雄。和那首歌里的英雄没什么不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高高山上的风♪......随英雄远去♪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行过长路♪......踏过荆棘♪......"},{"type":"narration","text":"也有其他人跟着哼起了歌。\n低低的歌声在房间流淌。\n我感到安宁。\n在拉特兰的夜里。\n暌违已久的安宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在想什么，修士先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，什么也没想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，塞茜莉亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是钟楼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是拉特兰的钟楼，很老很老的石塔，我还在拉特兰的时候，有时去那里看看，离天空很近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天上......妈妈现在就在那里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果你希望的话，她就在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......修士先生，能帮我一个忙吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
